; Creality K1C lubrication exercise - 2 cycles
; Configured limits: X -5..229, Y -0.5..227, Z -5..255
; Uses X 0..225, Y 2..223, Z 15..245
; Run with an empty build plate, cool nozzle, and supervision.
; Verify all motion is clear before starting. Stop if binding occurs.
G28
G90

; Starting position
G1 X110 Y110 F12000
G1 Z15 F900

; ===== CYCLE 1 =====
; Full-width X sweeps
G1 X0 Y15 F12000
G1 X225 Y15 F12000
G1 X0 Y110 F12000
G1 X225 Y110 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 F12000
G1 X225 Y223 F12000

; Full-length Y sweeps
G1 X225 Y2 F12000
G1 X110 Y223 F12000
G1 X110 Y2 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 F12000
G1 X0 Y2 F12000

; Diagonal movements
G1 X225 Y223 F12000
G1 X0 Y2 F12000
G1 X225 Y2 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 F12000

; Z oscillations with XY motion
G1 X225 Y223 Z35 F12000
G1 X0 Y2 Z20 F12000
G1 X225 Y2 Z45 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 Z30 F12000

; Large Z travel
G1 X110 Y110 F12000
G1 Z245 F900
G1 Z180 F900
G1 Z220 F900
G1 Z140 F900

; ===== CYCLE 2 =====
; X sweeps at mid Z
G1 X0 Y2 F12000
G1 X225 Y2 F12000
G1 X0 Y110 F12000
G1 X225 Y110 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 F12000
G1 X225 Y223 F12000

; Y sweeps
G1 X225 Y2 F12000
G1 X110 Y223 F12000
G1 X110 Y2 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 F12000
G1 X0 Y2 F12000

; Diagonal XYZ movements
G1 X225 Y223 Z160 F12000
G1 X0 Y2 Z145 F12000
G1 X225 Y2 Z170 F12000
G1 X0 Y223 Z155 F12000

; Final Z oscillations
G1 X110 Y110 F12000
G1 Z245 F900
G1 Z180 F900
G1 Z225 F900
G1 Z15 F900

; Finish
G1 X110 Y110 F12000
G1 Z100 F900
M400
